{"route":"/hop/wiki/perks/fortress","title":"Bone Fortress - House of Pips Wiki","description":"Bone Fortress (Epic perk) in House of Pips: Your remaining hand can award Rival no more than 10 points.","html":"<p class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks\">Perks</a> &rsaquo; <a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks#epic\">Epic</a></p>\n<article class=\"entry rarity-epic\" id=\"perk-fortress\">\n<header class=\"entry-head\">\n<img class=\"entry-icon\" src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/fortress-icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\">\n<div><h1>Bone Fortress</h1><p class=\"entry-sub\">Epic perk &middot; Hand award</p></div>\n</header>\n<div class=\"entry-body\">\n<div class=\"entry-main\">\n<blockquote class=\"card-text\"><p>Your remaining hand can award Rival no more than 10 points.</p><footer>In-game card text</footer></blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"how-it-works\">How it works</h2>\n<p>When you lose a hand, your remaining bones can award the winner <strong>at most 10 points</strong>.</p>\n<ul><li>The cap is applied first; <a class=\"ref rarity-common\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/soft_landing\" title=\"Common perk\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/soft_landing-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Soft Landing</a> then reduces it further, and <a class=\"ref rarity-malus\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/heavy_hand\" title=\"Malus\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/heavy_hand-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Heavy Hand</a> and <a class=\"ref rarity-malus\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/exposed\" title=\"Malus\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/exposed-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Exposed Hand</a> can push it back up.</li><li>Extra copies change nothing.</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"at-a-glance\">At a glance</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"facts\"><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\">Rarity</th><td><span class=\"pill rarity-epic\">Epic</span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Type</th><td>Hand award</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">How to get it</th><td>Unlock it in the Perks compendium for 900 Bone Bucks once you own 5 Rare perks.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"entry-card\"><a href=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/fortress-card.png\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/fortress-card.png\" alt=\"The Bone Fortress card as drawn in the game\" width=\"468\" height=\"498\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>The card as it appears in a draft.</figcaption></figure>\n</div>\n</article>\n<nav class=\"pager\" aria-label=\"Neighbouring perks\"><a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/domino_effect\">&larr; Domino Effect</a><a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/close\">Clean Finish &rarr;</a></nav>","toc":[]}